  "notes": "selfoss RSS reader. Each feed item has a teal/grey left border rule, a tiny coloured monogram favicon, title, user-coloured tag pills (Tech blue, News red, Climate green, Dev purple...), and a light-grey meta line (source•author•relative time•read time). Read items fade to grey title. Light-grey diagonal-hatch background texture behind the stream. Expanded item shows body in three newspaper-style columns with vertical rules, then a grey action bar (Star, Mark as read, Open, share to Twitter/Facebook/Pocket/Diaspora/email). Sidebar tags each have a 'Change color' swatch button (colour picker not verified). Search is hidden behind a magnifier tab at the sidebar edge. 'More' load button sits below the truncated screenshot (in a11y tree)."
